body.p:
If you need to number a fourth level of appendix, you can add the following rule in your
      customization
      CSS:*[class ~= "map/map"][numbering ^= 'deep'] *[class ~= "map/topicref"][is-chapter]:not([is-part]) > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] {
  counter-increment: toc-section3 toc-chapter-and-sections;
}

*[class ~= "map/map"][numbering ^= "deep"] *[class ~= "bookmap/appendix"][is-chapter]:not([is-part]) > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicmeta"]::before {
  content: counter(toc-chapter, upper-latin) "." counter(toc-section1) "." counter(toc-section2) "." counter(toc-section3) ". ";
}

*[class ~= "map/map"][numbering ^= 'deep'] *[class ~= "topic/topic"][topicrefclass ~= "bookmap/appendix"][is-chapter]:not([is-part]) > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/title"]:before {
  content: counter(chapter, upper-latin) "." counter(section1) "." counter(section2) "." counter(section3) ". ";
}

If you are using part and appendices, you
      can increase the appendix level by using these rules
      instead:*[class ~= "map/map"][numbering ^= 'deep'] *[class ~= "map/topicref"][is-chapter]:not([is-part]) > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] {
  counter-increment: toc-section3 toc-chapter-and-sections;
}

*[class ~= "map/map"][numbering ^= 'deep'] *[class ~= "bookmap/appendix"][is-part] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicmeta"]:before,
*[class ~= "map/map"][numbering ^= 'deep'] *[class ~= "bookmap/appendices"][is-part] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicref"] > *[class ~= "map/topicmeta"]:before {
  content: counter(toc-part, upper-latin) "." counter(toc-chapter) "." counter(toc-section1) "." counter(toc-section2) "." counter(toc-section3) ". ";
}

*[class ~= "map/map"][numbering ^= 'deep'] *[class ~= "topic/topic"][topicrefclass ~= "bookmap/appendix"][is-part] > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/title"]:before,
*[class ~= "map/map"][numbering ^= 'deep'] *[class ~= "topic/topic"][topicrefclass ~= "bookmap/appendices"][is-part] > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/topic"] > *[class ~= "topic/title"]:before {
  content: counter(part, upper-latin) "." counter(chapter) "." counter(section1) "." counter(section2) "." counter(section3) ". ";
}
